WinSparkle, the Windows software update library: https://winsparkle.org/

Used by Dainvo Office (--enable-dainvo-updater on Windows). sfx2 loads
WinSparkle.dll at run time (sfx2/source/appl/dainvoupdate.cxx), so nothing links
against it. License: MIT.

Not yet built or tested: Dainvo Office has no Windows build host so far.
